  "solution": "∵∠AOB=∠COD=90°，∠AOD=20°，\n∴∠COA=∠BOD=70°，\n∴∠BOC=∠COA+∠AOD+∠DOB，\n=70°+20°+70°，\n=160°.\n故答案为D.",
